SPECIAL ISSUE ARTICLE
The data science discovery program: A model for data science
consulting in higher education
C. Taylor Brown1 | Megan Mehta2 | Mahathi Ryali 2 | Xiaoran Dong 2 |
Iliya Shadfar 2 | Jacqueline Dominquez Davalos 2 | Aaron Culich 3 | Anthony Suen 2
1Data Science Discovery Program, Social Science Data Laboratory, School of Social Welfare, University of California, Berkeley, Berkeley, California, USA
